---
import ObfuscatedEmail from '../components/ObfuscatedEmail.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../lib/paths';
---

<Layout title="Imprint">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="bg-grid absolute inset-0"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 text-center sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
      <h1 class="text-glow text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">Imprint</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-brand-gray">Legal disclosure and contact information.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 pb-24 sm:px-6">
    <div class="space-y-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-ink-900/60 p-6 text-sm text-brand-gray sm:p-10">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Responsible for content</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Devsforge</p>
        <p class="mt-1">SmartMC is an independent, community-run project developed and maintained under the Devsforge name.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          For all inquiries relating to this website, the SmartMC mod, or the companion app, please get in touch by
          email: <ObfuscatedEmail class="text-brand-teal underline hover:text-teal-300" />.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Accuracy of content</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          The content of this website has been compiled with care and to the best of our knowledge. However, we
          cannot accept liability for the accuracy, completeness, or timeliness of the information provided.
          Statements about the SmartMC mod, its features, and its roadmap reflect the current state of development
          and may change without prior notice.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">External links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          This site links to third-party services and platforms, including but not limited to GitHub, Discord,
          Modrinth, and CurseForge. We have no influence over the content of external sites and accept no
          responsibility for it. The respective operator or provider of each linked page is always responsible for
          its content. Linked pages were checked for possible legal violations at the time of linking; no such
          violations were apparent at that time. A permanent review of linked content without concrete evidence of a
          violation is not reasonable.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-white">Copyright</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Unless otherwise noted, the text, images, and other content on this site are provided under the terms
          described on the{' '}
          <a class="text-brand-teal underline hover:text-teal-300" href={withBase('/license')}>License</a> page.
          Third-party brand marks, trademarks, and logos referenced or displayed on this site (including
          Minecraft, Mojang, Microsoft, GitHub, Discord, Modrinth, and CurseForge) remain the property of their
          respective owners and are used solely for identification purposes. SmartMC is not affiliated with, endorsed
          by, or sponsored by Mojang Studios or Microsoft.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
